    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20051113.0069\n\nGAZA, Nov. 13 , 2005 (Xinhua)\n\nIsraeli army kills two Palestinian militants\n\n\n\n\nTwo Palestinian militants were killed by Israeli forces overnight in two separate incidents, Palestinian medics said on Sunday.\n\nIsraeli troops shot dead 17-year-old Bilal Ashaar and wounded another Palestinian in the southern Gaza Strip late Thursday, said Moaweya Hasaneen, chief of emergency in the Palestinian Ministry of Public Health.\n\nIn a separate incident, Israeli troops shot dead a member of al- Aqsa Martyrs' Brigades, armed wing of the dominant Fatah movement, in the northern West Bank city of Jenin early on Sunday.\n\nIsrael Radio reported that Shujah al-Balawi, 20, was killed in an exchange of fire with Israeli troops. Two other militants were also wounded in the clash.\n\nIsraeli forces have stepped up raids and hunts for Palestinian militants after a deadly suicide bomb attack killed six Israelis last month.",
